></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The TIME CUBE: Grants a debuff to all enemies called &quot;Cubic Time&quot;. Enemies afflicted by cubic time will have the intensity of the damage and other debuffs applied to them multiplied by four.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121430/extras/5878776e4eae839b2e0ed0497631a61e.avif?t=1741553487\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cosmic Death Fungus: Enemies killed within the range of this tower will drop extra &quot;Awareness&quot; <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121430/extras/f03e4ab85aabe5698a869b0b8c8a1d7f.avif?t=1741553487\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Magnum Opus: Rapidly fires little projectiles that damage enemies over time <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121430/extras/411e322bd84fb2f52e9d77797e3f3bd5.avif?t=1741553487\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Cosmic Egg: When the egg hatches a Phoenix will be born. The Cosmic Phoenix will then traverse the enemy path back to its end damaging all enemies along the way. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121430/extras/06d24b879d39a907d66a1be326bd6ee2.avif?t=1741553487\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Anunnaki compass: Summons a meteor to damage many enemies within a given range. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121430/extras/944b7e7c2937f5b8924d86d2e4f6e93d.avif?t=1741553487\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p></li></ul>",
